# C# build dirs
**/bin/
**/obj/

# _build: ship only the runtime artefacts the exe/launcher load; ignore the rest
# (old HUD iterations, frida-compiled agents are regenerated, feed dumps, logs).
_build/*
!_build/capture.agent.js
!_build/bot_glue3.agent.js
!_build/YiXianHud23.dll
!_build/YiXianSimData.dll

# NOTE: _refs/ (DarkSun.HotUpdate.dll + DummyDll) ARE committed so the repo builds
# self-contained. They are extracted from the game (see README) — the game's
# copyright, included here by the repo owner's choice.
